    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061130.0297\n\nDOHA, Nov. 30 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nStarting line-up of Thailand women' soccer against China at Doha Asiad\n\n\n\n\nFollowing is the starting line-up of Thailand against China in the preliminary round of the women's soccer tournament at the Doha Asian Games here on Thursday:\n\nForwards: Sukunya Peangthem, Pitsamai Sornsai\n\nMidfielders: Junpen Seesraum, Wajee Kertsombun, Siriporn Mungkhala, Sunisa Srangthaisong\n\nDefenders: Darut Changplook, Ngoendi Phumphuang, Suphaphon Kaeobaen, Anootsara Maijarern\n\nGoalkeeper: Waraporn Boonsing",
